<title>USA: Lexington Cty, S.C., approves $61 mln school GOs.</title>
<headline>Lexington Cty, S.C., approves $61 mln school GOs.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, S.C. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voters in South Carolina's Lexington County School District 1 have approved a $61 million general obligation bond issue for schools.</p>
<p>The proposal passed by a margin of nearly 87 percent in voting Saturday, the State newspaper reported.</p>
<p>Proceeds will finance two new high schools, en elementary schools and the conversion of another high school to a middle school.</p>
<p>((--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013))</p>
